<BaseLayout title="Driveshaft" description="Driveshaft length, material, and yoke notes for LS Genesis Coupe swaps.">
  <h1>Driveshaft</h1>
  <p>
    Driveshaft length changes with the transmission and differential choice. Measure from the transmission output to the differential flange with the car at ride height.
  </p>
  <p>
    Chromoly and 7075 aluminum are both used. Chromoly is stronger; aluminum is lighter.
  </p>

